<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct $0.50-1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct $0.50-1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
